# El'Mariam API Tests
# Compatible with: VS Code REST Client, JetBrains HTTP Client, IntelliJ
#
# Usage:
#   1. Set @token below after running the OpenAuth login flow
#   2. Run requests individually with "Send Request" (REST Client)
#   3. Or run the curl equivalent shown beneath each request

### Variables
@gateway     = http://localhost:8009
@openauth    = http://localhost:3100
@hotel       = http://localhost:8003
@bar         = http://localhost:8004
@restaurant  = http://localhost:8005
@checkout    = http://localhost:8008

# Paste access_token here after login
